    "notes": "Owner-FCF CAGRs (SBC deducted) run slightly ABOVE reported FCF CAGRs: SBC (~0.8% of revenue) is growing slower than cash flow, so no stock-paid-growth flag. FY21-26 FCF growth includes Meggitt and the post-FY23 margin step-up; FY23 is depressed by Meggitt deal costs."
